WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:04.000
-Welcome back. We are here with
Anya Taylor-Joy everybody now.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:08.367
Anya, you're such
a talented actress.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:09.467
I told you I'm a big fan.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:11.100
You can make everything
dramatic.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.467
And since your latest movie is
all about food, we thought

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:16.133
we could put your acting skills
to the test by re-enacting

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.601
real text conversations people

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:20.467
have had with
their delivery drivers.

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:22.734
It's time for
"Dramatic Delivery."

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:24.868
Here we go.

00:00:24.868 --> 00:00:28.934
-♪ Dramatic delivery ♪

00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:30.501
-Okay.
-Alright.

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:33.834
Now, you should know that all
these texts are real, okay?

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:35.767
For this one, I will be playing
the customer.

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:37.501
You will be playing the driver.
Sound good?

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:38.901
-I'm ready. Got it.

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:42.267
[ Dramatic music plays ]

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:45.334
-Who is this?

00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:48.334
-Hello.
Your UberEats order is here.

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:51.868
-Oh, coming!
Are you at the main entrance?

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:54.200
-No.
I'm on top of the building.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.100
I just landed
with my helicopter.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.534
Yes, I'm at the main entrance.

00:00:59.534 --> 00:01:00.601
[ Laughter ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:02.667
-Just landed in your helicopter.

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:05.734
That's funny.
I like the sarcasm.

00:01:05.734 --> 00:01:07.200
-Yes.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.000
Yeah, I kind of want to be
friends with that person.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.601
That was good.
-Alright.

00:01:11.601 --> 00:01:13.434
For this one,
I will start this one.

00:01:13.434 --> 00:01:14.868
Here we go.
[ Clears throat ]

